   month = {9},
   note = {<b>From Duplicate 1 (<i>Determinants of neurodevelopment in early childhood - results from the Copenhagen prospective studies on asthma in childhood (COPSAC(2010) ) mother-child cohort</i> - Bjarnadottir, E; Stokholm, J; Chawes, B; Thorsen, J; Mora-Jensen, A C; Deleuran, M; Bonnelykke, K; Lauritzen, L; Bisgaard, H)<br/></b><br/>Bjarnadottir, Elin<br/>Stokholm, Jakob<br/>Chawes, Bo<br/>Thorsen, Jonathan<br/>Mora-Jensen, Anna-Rosa Cecilie<br/>Deleuran, Maja<br/>Bonnelykke, Klaus<br/>Lauritzen, Lotte<br/>Bisgaard, Hans<br/>eng<br/>Lundbeck Foundation/International<br/>Danish Council for Strategic Research/International<br/>Danish Council for Independent Research/International<br/>Capital Region Research Foundation/International<br/>Danish State Budget/International<br/>Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't<br/>Norway<br/>2019/02/13<br/>Acta Paediatr. 2019 Sep;108(9):1632-1641. doi: 10.1111/apa.14753. Epub 2019 Mar 21.},
